# MUILA ATM - Java Project

## About
This is my first Java programming project. It simulates a simple ATM system using Java.

## Features
- PIN verification
- View available balance
- Deposit money with a minimum deposit of R50
- Withdraw money
- Display remaining balance after withdrawal
- Limit incorrect PIN attempts

## Technologies Used
- Java
- Scanner for user input
- If/else statements
- While loops
- Variables and arithmetic operations

## How to Run
1. Open the project in NetBeans.
2. Run `BankBalance.java`.
3. Follow the instructions displayed in the console.

## Purpose
This project is part of my learning journey as an ICT and Application Development student.
